# armour/woman/plate_hang: the plate tassets on the woman (the same plates under her hem rules) (P2c slice; re-shaded by LADDER-ARMOUR, STYLE_P2 25.2 / 25.6 / 27.5):
# two rigid plates hinged at the belt (the fork between them), each lit at its top-left corner (step 3) over step-2 and
# step-1 planes, a lower lame; tassets shift whole by a pixel in the run's flare and never bend. Finish regions: R the
# lower lame's edge (the hem), N the hinge line between the lames, W a spot on the shadow tasset.
# Keys: the hang channel (rest wide flare lie idle sit floor kneel ride) in D U R L. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# (LADDER-ARMOUR i3) N (T6 runes) only on the breastplate's lower edge: one designed rune band, not specks over the gorget,
# the chest and the tassets (the blind panel: "scattered 1px specks that look like noise").
# (LADDER-ARMOUR polish i3) T5 wears its people's colour: the surcoat in the accent slot (tabardColor), the skirt's
# cross gilt, so T5 reads red-and-gold, the Mythic white-black-and-fire, T6 blue-and-silver (the panel: "T5 and Mythic
# both red and gold, one outline").
# (LADDER-ARMOUR alloys i1) the Mythic body in its own BLACKENED steel (metal slot, kind 11), not linen: the
# owner saw a white slab with no dark values; dark plate, white-hot edges, gold trim and fire carry it.
# (LADDER-ARMOUR alloys i1) a step-4 specular on the lit top of the first scales / lames / plates (top-left light):
# with no step 4 a coloured alloy read as clay; the glint and the dark core make any metal read as metal.
# (LADDER-ARMOUR alloys i2) the Mythic's side tassets end in a gilt hem (R) facing D/U, so its dark greaves part from
# the black skirt in the walk (the panel: "the dark legs vanish against its own black skirt").
# (FORGE-LIMBS silhouettes i2) the base tassets facing D/U flare 1-2 px past the hips at the lower plate (16 px wide):
# on the 1x outline they part from a bare hip (the shapes sheet: TASSETS against NONE).
# (FORGE-LIMBS silhouettes i3) the base tassets facing D/U as two stepped plates, 12 px under the fauld to 18 px at the
# lower lame (3-4 px past the thighs), in every hang key incl. the run's flare: TASSETS parts from NONE on the 1x outline.
use person
body woman
role armour plate
role overlay skirt.tassets
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
z 10
legend Q linen 0
legend R linen 1
legend S linen 2
legend T linen 3
legend U linen 4
legend J cloak 0
legend D cloak 1
legend H cloak 2
legend I cloak 3
legend X cloak 4
legend k device 1
legend l device 2
legend F device 3

